        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "原书还列出静电单位制（CGSE）的形式。\n这一单位制的电荷与场强单位、常数约定不同，不能把国际单位制的数值直接混用。\n在同样的理想介质条件下，点电荷的场强大小为：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 161,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0170#6"
          ],
          "source_text": "在静电单位制中，点电荷的电场强度",
          "changes": [
            "wording",
            "layout",
            "conditions"
          ],
          "numeric_changes": [],
          "historical_entities": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$E=\\frac{|q|}{\\varepsilon r^2}$。\n(8-14)",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 161,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0170#7"
          ],
          "source_text": "$E=\\frac{|q|}{\\varepsilon r^2}$. (8-14)",
          "changes": [
            "wording",
            "layout",
            "conditions"
          ],
          "numeric_changes": [],
          "historical_entities": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**场的叠加原理**\n固定场源电荷$q_1$和$q_2$的位置与电荷量，考虑它们在同一位置对试探电荷$q$的电场力。\n分别计算$q_1$和$q_2$的贡献，记为$\\vec{F}_1$和$\\vec{F}_2$，合力等于这两个力的矢量和，而不是通常意义上两个大小的直接相加。",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 161,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0170#8"
          ],
          "source_text": "**场的叠加原理** 两个电荷$q_1$和$q_2$对点电荷$q$的作用力的合力，等于每个电荷$q_1$和$q_2$的作用力$\\vec{F}_1$和$\\vec{F}_2$的几何和.",
          "changes": [
            "wording",
            "layout",
            "conditions"
          ],
          "numeric_changes": [],
          "historical_entities": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "分别使用电场力与场强的关系：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 161,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0170#9"
          ],
          "source_text": "因为",
          "changes": [
            "wording",
            "layout",
            "conditions"
          ],
          "numeric_changes": [],
          "historical_entities": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$\\vec{F}_1=q\\vec{E}_1$ 和 $\\vec{F}_2=q\\vec{E}_2$，",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 161,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0170#10"
          ],
          "source_text": "$\\vec{F}_1=q\\vec{E}_1$ 和 $\\vec{F}_2=q\\vec{E}_2$，",
          "changes": [],
          "numeric_changes": [],
          "historical_entities": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "这里，$\\vec{E}_1$和$\\vec{E}_2$分别是源电荷$q_1$和$q_2$在同一观察点产生的场强。\n在真空或线性介质的静电模型中，力的矢量相加给出：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 161,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0170#11"
          ],
          "source_text": "式中$\\vec{E}_1$和$\\vec{E}_2$是电荷$q_1$和$q_2$产生的电场强度，所以，",
          "changes": [
            "wording",
            "layout",
            "conditions"
          ],
          "numeric_changes": [],
          "historical_entities": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$\\vec{F}=q\\vec{E}_1+q\\vec{E}_2=q(\\vec{E}_1+\\vec{E}_2)$。",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 161,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0170#12"
          ],
          "source_text": "$\\vec{F}=q\\vec{E}_1+q\\vec{E}_2=q(\\vec{E}_1+\\vec{E}_2)$.",
          "changes": [
            "wording",
            "layout",
            "conditions"
          ],
          "numeric_changes": [],
          "historical_entities": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "因此，矢量和$\\vec{E}_1+\\vec{E}_2$就是试探电荷$q$所在位置的合电场强度$\\vec{E}$，如图114所示。\n图中的平行四边形表示同一点的矢量相加关系，不是电荷或试探粒子的运动轨迹：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 161,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0170#13"
          ],
          "source_text": "从这个等式可以得出：应当把几何和$\\vec{E}_1+\\vec{E}_2$**看做为电荷$q$****所在的点的合电场强度**$\\vec{E}$(图114)：",
          "changes": [
            "wording",
            "layout",
            "conditions"
          ],
          "numeric_changes": [],
          "historical_entities": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$\\vec{E}=\\frac{\\vec{F}}{q}=\\vec{E}_1+\\vec{E}_2$。",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 161,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0170#14"
          ],
          "source_text": "$\\vec{E}=\\frac{\\vec{F}}{q}=\\vec{E}_1+\\vec{E}_2$.",
          "changes": [
            "wording",
            "layout",
            "conditions"
          ],
          "numeric_changes": [],
          "historical_entities": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "这种把各场源在同一点的场强作矢量相加的方法，称为**场的叠加原理**。",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 161,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0170#15"
          ],
          "source_text": "这就是场的**叠加原理**.",
          "changes": [
            "wording",
            "layout",
            "conditions"
          ],
          "numeric_changes": [],
          "historical_entities": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "对多个给定场源，在真空或上述线性静电模型中也可以同样处理。\n如果它们在空间某一点分别产生电场强度$\\vec{E}_1$、$\\vec{E}_2$、$\\vec{E}_3$等，则合场强为：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 161,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0170#16"
          ],
          "source_text": "在一般情况下，叠加原理表述为：**如果几个不同的带电****粒子在空间某一点产生的电场强度分别为$\\vec{E}_1$、$\\vec{E}_2$、$\\vec{E}_3$等等，则****在该点的合电场强度等于**",
          "changes": [
            "wording",
            "layout",
            "conditions"
          ],
          "numeric_changes": [],
          "historical_entities": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$\\vec{E}=\\vec{E}_1+\\vec{E}_2+\\vec{E}_3+\\cdots$。\n(8-15)",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 161,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0170#17"
          ],
          "source_text": "$\\vec{E}=\\vec{E}_1+\\vec{E}_2+\\vec{E}_3+\\cdots$. (8-15)",
          "changes": [
            "wording",
            "layout",
            "conditions"
          ],
          "numeric_changes": [],
          "historical_entities": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "叠加原理说的是：在适用的线性静电模型中，给定场源分布时，总电场是各场源贡献的矢量和，并不是说各个带电体之间没有相互作用。\n带电体仍可受力并改变位置，导体上的电荷也可能重新分布；\n一旦场源分布改变，就应按新的分布重新计算。\n\n对于由固定点电荷组成、满足(8-13)式条件的系统，先求各电荷在所考察位置的场强，再作矢量相加即可。\n这个结论不能直接套用于非线性介质；\n点电荷理想模型的场强公式在场源所在点没有定义。",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 162,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0171#1"
          ],
          "source_text": "叠加原理表明：当几个电场放在一起时，它们彼此不产生任何影响. 由于有了叠加原理，所以为了求带电粒子系统**在任意点的**电场强度，只要知道点电荷电场强度的表示式(8-13)就是够了.",
          "changes": [
            "wording",
            "layout",
            "conditions"
          ],
          "numeric_changes": [],
          "historical_entities": []
        }
      ],
      "schema": "ld-s10y-lesson/edition-lesson@1",
      "edition": "modern-us-neutral",
      "status": "draft",
      "source": {
        "path": "lessons/phy9-c2-s2-n67/lesson.json",
        "sha256": "4c5ebd34b5c6924bde70da36ec36014aef2935da6687146dff7334c04ba4bf1b",
        "data": {
          "id": "phy9-c2-s2-n67",
          "card_id": "phy9-c2-s2-n67",
          "chapter": "第二编 电动力学基础",
          "section": "第八章 静电学",
          "number": "67",
          "title": "电场强度 场的叠加原理",
          "printed_title": "67. 电场强度 场的叠加原理",
          "start_page": 168,
          "start_printed": 159,
          "figures": [
            {
              "id": "fig-113",
              "label": "图113",
              "page": 170
            },
            {
              "id": "fig-114",
              "label": "图114",
              "page": 170
            }
          ],
          "exercise_count": 0,
          "prose": [
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "text": "电场是什么的概念，是在实验研究电场性质的过程中形成的. 随着电动力学的研究，我们将认识新的内容和电场的新的性质.",
              "id": null,
              "label": null,
              "printed_page": 159,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0168#4"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "text": "**电场的主要性质是它对电荷施以力的作用** 根据对电荷的作用，人们断定了电场的存在，以及它在空间中的分布，并研究了它的全部特性.",
              "id": null,
              "label": null,
              "printed_page": 159,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0168#5"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "text": "静止电荷的电场叫做**静电场**. 电场存在于电荷周围的空间中，并与电荷有密切的联系. 今后我们还要介绍与电荷没有密切联系的随时间变化的**交变电场**. 但是，交变电场对电荷的作用，完全与静电场一样. 静电场和交变电场在许多性质方面是一样的. 然而，它们之间也有差异. 谈到场的性质时，如果这个性质完全是**静电场或交变电场**所固有的，则我们把这个场简称为电场.",
              "id": null,
              "label": null,
              "printed_page": 159,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0168#6"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "text": "**电场强度** 电场是根据对电荷的作用力来发现的. 可以断言：如果我们知道了场中任意点对任意电荷的作用力，那么我们就了解了电场.",
              "id": null,
              "label": null,
              "printed_page": 159,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0168#7"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "text": "如果把几个不大的带电体分别放在场中的同一点，并测量力，则发现：电场对电荷的作用力与电荷的电量成正比. 实际上，场是点电荷产生的. 根据库仑定律(8-9)，对置于场中的电荷$q$的作用力，与电荷$q$成正比. 因此，电场对场中某点的电荷的作用力与电荷电量的比值，与电荷的电量无关，从而可以作为场的一个特性. 人们把这个特性叫做**电场强度**. 象力一样，电场强度是一个矢量. 用字母$\\vec{E}$表示它. 根据定义",
              "id": null,
              "label": null,
              "printed_page": 159,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0168#8",
                "p0169#1"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "text": "$\\vec{E}=\\frac{\\vec{F}}{q}$. (8-11)",
              "id": null,
              "label": null,
              "printed_page": 160,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0169#2"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "text": "**某一点的电场强度等于电场对点电荷的作用力与电荷电****量的比值，是一个矢量.**",
              "id": null,
              "label": null,
              "printed_page": 160,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0169#3"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "text": "由此得出，电场对电荷$q$的作用力等于",
              "id": null,
              "label": null,
              "printed_page": 160,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0169#4"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "text": "$\\vec{F}=q\\vec{E}$. (8-12)",
              "id": null,
              "label": null,
              "printed_page": 160,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0169#5"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "text": "**如果$q>0$**，则矢量$\\vec{E}$和$\\vec{F}$的方向相同；当$q<0$时，这两个矢量的方向相反. 矢量$\\vec{E}$的方向与电荷$q$的符号无关. 它的方向是电场对正电荷作用力的方向.",
              "id": null,
              "label": null,
              "printed_page": 160,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0169#6"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "text": "根据(8-11)式，电场强度的单位在国际单位制中是牛顿/库仑.",
              "id": null,
              "label": null,
              "printed_page": 160,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0169#7"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "text": "**点电荷的电场强度** 我们求点电荷$q$所产生的电场强度. 根据库仑定律，这个电荷对另一电荷$q_0$的作用力在国际单位制中等于",
              "id": null,
              "label": null,
              "printed_page": 160,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0169#8"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "text": "$F=\\frac{|q|\\cdot|q_0|}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon r^2}$.",
              "id": null,
              "label": null,
              "printed_page": 160,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0169#9"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "text": "离产生电场的点电荷距离为$r$处的电场强度的大小等于",
              "id": null,
              "label": null,
              "printed_page": 160,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0169#10"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "text": "$E=\\frac{F}{q_0}=\\frac{|q|}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon r^2}$. (8-13)",
              "id": null,
              "label": null,
              "printed_page": 160,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0169#11"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "text": "**如果$q>0$**，则电场中任意点的电场强度的方向是沿着半径背向$q$；**如果$q<0$**，则电场强度的方向是沿着半径指向$q$(图113).",
              "id": null,
              "label": null,
              "printed_page": 160,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0169#12",
                "p0170#1"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "fig",
              "text": "",
              "id": "fig-113",
              "label": "图113",
              "printed_page": 161,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0170#2"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "cap",
              "text": "图113",
              "id": null,
              "label": "图113",
              "printed_page": 161,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0170#3"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "fig",
              "text": "",
              "id": "fig-114",
              "label": "图114",
              "printed_page": 161,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0170#4"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "cap",
              "text": "图114",
              "id": null,
              "label": "图114",
              "printed_page": 161,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0170#5"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "text": "在静电单位制中，点电荷的电场强度",
              "id": null,
              "label": null,
              "printed_page": 161,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0170#6"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "text": "$E=\\frac{|q|}{\\varepsilon r^2}$. (8-14)",
              "id": null,
              "label": null,
              "printed_page": 161,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0170#7"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "text": "**场的叠加原理** 两个电荷$q_1$和$q_2$对点电荷$q$的作用力的合力，等于每个电荷$q_1$和$q_2$的作用力$\\vec{F}_1$和$\\vec{F}_2$的几何和.",
              "id": null,
              "label": null,
              "printed_page": 161,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0170#8"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "text": "因为",
              "id": null,
              "label": null,
              "printed_page": 161,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0170#9"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "text": "$\\vec{F}_1=q\\vec{E}_1$ 和 $\\vec{F}_2=q\\vec{E}_2$，",
              "id": null,
              "label": null,
              "printed_page": 161,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0170#10"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "text": "式中$\\vec{E}_1$和$\\vec{E}_2$是电荷$q_1$和$q_2$产生的电场强度，所以，",
              "id": null,
              "label": null,
              "printed_page": 161,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0170#11"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "text": "$\\vec{F}=q\\vec{E}_1+q\\vec{E}_2=q(\\vec{E}_1+\\vec{E}_2)$.",
              "id": null,
              "label": null,
              "printed_page": 161,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0170#12"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "text": "从这个等式可以得出：应当把几何和$\\vec{E}_1+\\vec{E}_2$**看做为电荷$q$****所在的点的合电场强度**$\\vec{E}$(图114)：",
              "id": null,
              "label": null,
              "printed_page": 161,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0170#13"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "text": "$\\vec{E}=\\frac{\\vec{F}}{q}=\\vec{E}_1+\\vec{E}_2$.",
              "id": null,
              "label": null,
              "printed_page": 161,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0170#14"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "text": "这就是场的**叠加原理**.",
              "id": null,
              "label": null,
              "printed_page": 161,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0170#15"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "text": "在一般情况下，叠加原理表述为：**如果几个不同的带电****粒子在空间某一点产生的电场强度分别为$\\vec{E}_1$、$\\vec{E}_2$、$\\vec{E}_3$等等，则****在该点的合电场强度等于**",
              "id": null,
              "label": null,
              "printed_page": 161,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0170#16"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "text": "$\\vec{E}=\\vec{E}_1+\\vec{E}_2+\\vec{E}_3+\\cdots$. (8-15)",
              "id": null,
              "label": null,
              "printed_page": 161,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0170#17"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "text": "叠加原理表明：当几个电场放在一起时，它们彼此不产生任何影响. 由于有了叠加原理，所以为了求带电粒子系统**在任意点的**电场强度，只要知道点电荷电场强度的表示式(8-13)就是够了.",
              "id": null,
              "label": null,
              "printed_page": 162,
              "source_refs": [
                "p0171#1"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "section_breaks": [
        {
          "before": "本课的静电结论并不自动适用于所有变化的场。\n说明两者共有的性质时，可以统称为电场。",
          "after": "**电场强度**描述给定位置的电场力作用。\n用尺寸足够小、对原有电荷分布的扰动可以忽略的带电体作为试探电荷，才能用它的受力表征待研究的场。\n本课讨论近似静止的试探电荷及其电场力。"
        },
        {
          "before": "由(8-11)式可知，国际单位制中的电场强度单位为牛顿/库仑。",
          "after": "**点电荷的电场强度**\n把场源电荷$q$视为点电荷，选择电荷$q_0$为正的试探电荷，并使它对场源的扰动可以忽略。\n在均匀、线性、各向同性介质的理想静电模型中，忽略介质边界、电荷体尺寸和局域效应；"
        },
        {
          "before": "$E=\\frac{|q|}{\\varepsilon r^2}$。\n(8-14)",
          "after": "**场的叠加原理**\n固定场源电荷$q_1$和$q_2$的位置与电荷量，考虑它们在同一位置对试探电荷$q$的电场力。\n分别计算$q_1$和$q_2$的贡献，记为$\\vec{F}_1$和$\\vec{F}_2$，合力等于这两个力的矢量和，而不是通常意义上两个大小的直接相加。"
        }
      ],
      "errata": []
    },
