          "source_refs": [
            "p0168#5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "静止电荷的电场叫做**静电场**. 电场存在于电荷周围的空间中，并与电荷有密切的联系. 今后我们还要介绍与电荷没有密切联系的随时间变化的**交变电场**. 但是，交变电场对电荷的作用，完全与静电场一样. 静电场和交变电场在许多性质方面是一样的. 然而，它们之间也有差异. 谈到场的性质时，如果这个性质完全是**静电场或交变电场**所固有的，则我们把这个场简称为电场.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 159,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0168#6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**电场强度** 电场是根据对电荷的作用力来发现的. 可以断言：如果我们知道了场中任意点对任意电荷的作用力，那么我们就了解了电场.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 159,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0168#7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "如果把几个不大的带电体分别放在场中的同一点，并测量力，则发现：电场对电荷的作用力与电荷的电量成正比. 实际上，场是点电荷产生的. 根据库仑定律(8-9)，对置于场中的电荷$q$的作用力，与电荷$q$成正比. 因此，电场对场中某点的电荷的作用力与电荷电量的比值，与电荷的电量无关，从而可以作为场的一个特性. 人们把这个特性叫做**电场强度**. 象力一样，电场强度是一个矢量. 用字母$\\vec{E}$表示它. 根据定义",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 159,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0168#8",
            "p0169#1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$\\vec{E}=\\frac{\\vec{F}}{q}$. (8-11)",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 160,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0169#2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**某一点的电场强度等于电场对点电荷的作用力与电荷电****量的比值，是一个矢量.**",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 160,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0169#3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "由此得出，电场对电荷$q$的作用力等于",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 160,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0169#4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$\\vec{F}=q\\vec{E}$. (8-12)",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 160,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0169#5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**如果$q>0$**，则矢量$\\vec{E}$和$\\vec{F}$的方向相同；当$q<0$时，这两个矢量的方向相反. 矢量$\\vec{E}$的方向与电荷$q$的符号无关. 它的方向是电场对正电荷作用力的方向.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 160,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0169#6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "根据(8-11)式，电场强度的单位在国际单位制中是牛顿/库仑.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 160,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0169#7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**点电荷的电场强度** 我们求点电荷$q$所产生的电场强度. 根据库仑定律，这个电荷对另一电荷$q_0$的作用力在国际单位制中等于",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 160,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0169#8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$F=\\frac{|q|\\cdot|q_0|}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon r^2}$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 160,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0169#9"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "离产生电场的点电荷距离为$r$处的电场强度的大小等于",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 160,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0169#10"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$E=\\frac{F}{q_0}=\\frac{|q|}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon r^2}$. (8-13)",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 160,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0169#11"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**如果$q>0$**，则电场中任意点的电场强度的方向是沿着半径背向$q$；**如果$q<0$**，则电场强度的方向是沿着半径指向$q$(图113).",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 160,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0169#12",
            "p0170#1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "fig",
          "text": "",
          "id": "fig-113",
          "label": "图113",
          "printed_page": 161,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0170#2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "cap",
          "text": "图113",
          "id": null,
          "label": "图113",
          "printed_page": 161,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0170#3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "fig",
          "text": "",
          "id": "fig-114",
          "label": "图114",
          "printed_page": 161,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0170#4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "cap",
          "text": "图114",
          "id": null,
          "label": "图114",
          "printed_page": 161,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0170#5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "在静电单位制中，点电荷的电场强度",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 161,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0170#6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$E=\\frac{|q|}{\\varepsilon r^2}$. (8-14)",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 161,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0170#7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**场的叠加原理** 两个电荷$q_1$和$q_2$对点电荷$q$的作用力的合力，等于每个电荷$q_1$和$q_2$的作用力$\\vec{F}_1$和$\\vec{F}_2$的几何和.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 161,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0170#8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "因为",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 161,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0170#9"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$\\vec{F}_1=q\\vec{E}_1$ 和 $\\vec{F}_2=q\\vec{E}_2$，",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 161,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0170#10"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "式中$\\vec{E}_1$和$\\vec{E}_2$是电荷$q_1$和$q_2$产生的电场强度，所以，",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 161,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0170#11"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$\\vec{F}=q\\vec{E}_1+q\\vec{E}_2=q(\\vec{E}_1+\\vec{E}_2)$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 161,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0170#12"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "从这个等式可以得出：应当把几何和$\\vec{E}_1+\\vec{E}_2$**看做为电荷$q$****所在的点的合电场强度**$\\vec{E}$(图114)：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 161,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0170#13"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$\\vec{E}=\\frac{\\vec{F}}{q}=\\vec{E}_1+\\vec{E}_2$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 161,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0170#14"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "这就是场的**叠加原理**.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 161,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0170#15"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "在一般情况下，叠加原理表述为：**如果几个不同的带电****粒子在空间某一点产生的电场强度分别为$\\vec{E}_1$、$\\vec{E}_2$、$\\vec{E}_3$等等，则****在该点的合电场强度等于**",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 161,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0170#16"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$\\vec{E}=\\vec{E}_1+\\vec{E}_2+\\vec{E}_3+\\cdots$. (8-15)",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 161,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0170#17"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "叠加原理表明：当几个电场放在一起时，它们彼此不产生任何影响. 由于有了叠加原理，所以为了求带电粒子系统**在任意点的**电场强度，只要知道点电荷电场强度的表示式(8-13)就是够了.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 162,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0171#1"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
